  "matched_resource_statement": "all three modes issue exactly one decoder call per proposal over an identical mask schedule",
  "insertability_guard_analytic_note": "For a 3-order suffix with mask_fraction 0.5 there are exactly 3 possible 2-subsets to mask, and 2 of them leave a single retained order at the start or end of the chain, so both of its depot edges are retained and NO insertion position is free. Without the guard roughly two thirds of proposals at this size would return a truncated route. In this run 5 of 6 seeds happened to draw the one safe mask and 1 drew a degenerate one, hence exactly one guard activation per case: the sampled rate understates the analytical rate, so both are reported.",
  "guard_effect_disclosed": "when the guard fires, the retained set is emptied, so that proposal is a from-scratch insertion of all orders rather than a re-insertion into a retained partial route; the per-seed flag mask_extended_to_all_for_insertability records exactly which proposals those were",
  "what_this_qualifies": [
    "a pickup masked-reconstruction arm exists and the frozen encoder+decoder are reused unchanged from the qualified delivery provider",
    "the guide demonstrably changes the proposed candidate (positive control)",
    "the discard control is behaviourally identical to the reconstruction-only control, so it isolates throughput from information (negative control)",
    "inference leaves the parameters bit-identical"
  ],
